  "scope": "Fixed 23x8 Minsky table executed by the Coq model of the literal NaN16 fixture mth/tests/mth_minsky_test.nas (184x8 table image at fixture_table_base = 104, flat tape at fixture_tape_base = 4096). Source side: the left-infinite binary-tape source model on all well-formed inputs: Forall (wide_row_wellformed p) rows, rows <> [], length (lic_state c) = p, and left_infinite_ok c.",
  "window_note": "The theorem asserts exists K t, K >= t. K is the left-window depth and may grow with the native run time t; a total run-time-independent encode is not claimed. The window premise is discharged inside the theorem for the existential K, not assumed separately.",
